+- **Type:** Rounded uses the system UI stack (`--font-ui`); Minimal uses Inter for UI and Geist Mono for keys and counts, shipped in `assets/fonts/` and loaded by `tokens/typography.css`. Scale 12/14/16/18/20/24. Body 14/20. Section headings 16 semibold. Item overlay title 24 semibold. Board title 18 bold white. Weights: 400 body, 500 buttons, 600 headings, 700 board title.
